{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2021-09-15 15:00:00', 'title': 'ALEX PURDY TO DISCUSS FORD CONNECTED SERVICES GROWTH AT EVERCORE ISI AUTOTECH & AI FORUM', 'text': "DEARBORN, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALEX PURDY, FORD'S DIRECTOR OF BUSINESS OPERATIONS, ENTERPRISE CONNECTIVITY, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT WITH AUTOS ANALYST CHRIS MCNALLY AT THE EVERCORE ISI AUTOTECH & AI FORUM AT 11:00 A.M. ET ON WEDNESDAY, SEPT. 22. PURDY WILL DISCUSS HOW THE COMPANY IS DELIVERING ON THE FORD+ PLAN TO DRIVE GROWTH IN CONNECTED SERVICES. HE'LL EXPLAIN HOW FORD IS DOING THAT BY BUILDING SOFTWARE CAPABILITIES AND PARTNERING WITH OTHER TECH COMPANIES TO DEVELOP ALWAY"}